# probe (quest rework P8): spell <id>, a spell the char knows: a char_spells row before the login, a GM's
# player:addSpell(<id>) after it. Waking the Beast (otherAreas 32, still Lua): La Theine's qm3 plays 207 the first time
# only when the char knows the six avatar spells (Ifrit 298, Titan 299, Leviathan 300, Garuda 301, Shiva 302, Ramuh 303).
# Five by header lines: qm3: no section (STRANGE_ENERGY). Ramuh by a step: 207; finished: the Rainbow Resonator, begun.
lists LaTheinePlateau/qm3/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/207
char zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-178.2,8.8,254.3 job=SMN lvl=75
spell 298
spell 299
spell 300
spell 301
spell 302
login
trigger qm3                             # five of the six: no section; STRANGE_ENERGY
spell 303                               # a GM: Ramuh
trigger qm3                             # the six: 207
finish                                  # the Rainbow Resonator; begun
